{"id":"58bc4bb10c0e1cf7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/138_二阶算术_Z₂.md","title":"138 二阶算术 Z₂","display":"138_二阶算术_Z₂","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>数变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NVar}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NVar}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>集合变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且二者不交。函数符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0:0,\\quad S:1,\\quad +:2,\\quad \\times:2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0:0,\\quad S:1,\\quad +:2,\\quad \\times:2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"&lt;:2,\\qquad \\in:(\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{SVar}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[&lt;:2,\\qquad \\in:(\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{SVar}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逻辑构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\doteq,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\forall^0,\\quad \\forall^1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\doteq,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\forall^0,\\quad \\forall^1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_2\">\\(Z_2\\)</span> 的目标差异是全二阶可理解：每个二阶公式都定义一个集合，而不是只允许算术公式、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span> 公式或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^1_1\">\\(\\Delta^1_1\\)</span> 公式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(S(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\">\\(s+t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\times t\">\\(s\\times t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;t\">\\(s&lt;t\\)</span> 为公式；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in X\">\\(t\\in X\\)</span> 为公式；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(\\forall XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>派生联结词和量词只作为下列缩写使用：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\quad\n\\exists XA:=\\neg\\forall X\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\quad\n\\exists XA:=\\neg\\forall X\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>项自由数变量为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV_T}(s+t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV_T}(s+t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVN}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FVN}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FVS}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVN}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FVN}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV_T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FVS}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVN}(t\\in X)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(t\\in X)=\\{X\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVN}(t\\in X)=\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(t\\in X)=\\{X\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVN}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVN}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVN}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVN}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVS}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVN}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVN}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVS}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVN}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVN}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVN}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\setminus\\{X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVN}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{FVN}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVS}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\setminus\\{X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数项替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\\quad S(r)[x:=t]=S(r[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\\quad S(r)[x:=t]=S(r[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(r+u)[x:=t]=r[x:=t]+u[x:=t],\\quad\n(r\\times u)[x:=t]=r[x:=t]\\times u[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(r+u)[x:=t]=r[x:=t]+u[x:=t],\\quad\n(r\\times u)[x:=t]=r[x:=t]\\times u[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}^0(U)=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin U\\}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}^0(U)=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin U\\}}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}^1(V)=X_{\\min\\{i:X_i\\notin V\\}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}^1(V)=X_{\\min\\{i:X_i\\notin V\\}}\\)</span>。定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{Z_2}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{NVar}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^{Z_2}:\n\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{NVar}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_N^{Z_2}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{NVar}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_N^{Z_2}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{NVar}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_S^{Z_2}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{SVar}\\times\\mathsf{SVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_S^{Z_2}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{SVar}\\times\\mathsf{SVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换在原子和联结词上的子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\doteq v[x:=t]),\\quad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]&lt;v[x:=t]),\\quad\n(u\\in X)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\in X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\doteq v[x:=t]),\\quad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]&lt;v[x:=t]),\\quad\n(u\\in X)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\in X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\in Z)[X:=Y]=\n\\begin{cases}u\\in Y,&amp;Z=X,\\\\u\\in Z,&amp;Z\\ne X,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\in Z)[X:=Y]=\n\\begin{cases}u\\in Y,&amp;Z=X,\\\\u\\in Z,&amp;Z\\ne X,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[\\sigma]=\\neg(A[\\sigma]),\\quad\n(A\\to B)[\\sigma]=(A[\\sigma]\\to B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[\\sigma]=\\neg(A[\\sigma]),\\quad\n(A\\to B)[\\sigma]=(A[\\sigma]\\to B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yA,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yA,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FV_T}(t),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}^0(\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}^0(\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV_T}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall ZA)[X:=Y]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall ZA,&amp;Z=X,\\\\\n\\forall Z(A[X:=Y]),&amp;Z\\ne X\\land Z\\ne Y,\\\\\n\\forall W((A[Z:=W])[X:=Y]),&amp;Z\\ne X\\land Z=Y,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall ZA)[X:=Y]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall ZA,&amp;Z=X,\\\\\n\\forall Z(A[X:=Y]),&amp;Z\\ne X\\land Z\\ne Y,\\\\\n\\forall W((A[Z:=W])[X:=Y]),&amp;Z\\ne X\\land Z=Y,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W=\\operatorname{fresh}^1(\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\cup\\{X,Y,Z\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W=\\operatorname{fresh}^1(\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\cup\\{X,Y,Z\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundN}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundN}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundS}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundS}\\)</span> 在原子上取空集，在否定上保持不变，在蕴含上取并，并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundN}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{BoundS}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BoundS}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundN}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{BoundS}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BoundS}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundN}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{BoundN}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BoundS}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{BoundS}(A)\\cup\\{X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundN}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{BoundN}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BoundS}(\\forall XA)=\\operatorname{BoundS}(A)\\cup\\{X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由改名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_N(A,x,y)=A[x:=y]\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeRen}_N(A,x,y)=A[x:=y]\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_S(A,X,Y)=A[X:=Y]\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeRen}_S(A,X,Y)=A[X:=Y]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span>，\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_{Z_2}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}_{Z_2}(R)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是等价关系，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R(A,B)\\Longrightarrow R(\\neg A,\\neg B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R(A,B)\\Longrightarrow R(\\neg A,\\neg B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R(A_0,B_0)\\land R(A_1,B_1)\n\\Longrightarrow R(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R(A_0,B_0)\\land R(A_1,B_1)\n\\Longrightarrow R(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R(A,B)\\Longrightarrow R(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\land R(\\forall XA,\\forall XB),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R(A,B)\\Longrightarrow R(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\land R(\\forall XA,\\forall XB),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Longrightarrow R(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y])),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\notin\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Longrightarrow R(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y])),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Y\\notin\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\setminus\\{X\\}\n\\Longrightarrow R(\\forall XA,\\forall Y(A[X:=Y])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Y\\notin\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\setminus\\{X\\}\n\\Longrightarrow R(\\forall XA,\\forall Y(A[X:=Y])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall R(\\operatorname{Comp}_{Z_2}(R)\\to R(A,B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall R(\\operatorname{Comp}_{Z_2}(R)\\to R(A,B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-逻辑与算术公理\">4. 逻辑与算术公理</h1>\n<p>二阶逻辑公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{2Logic}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{S}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0D}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1D}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{=R}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=Sub}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{2Logic}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{S}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0D}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1E}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1D}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{=R}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=Sub}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{S}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{S}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0E}=\n\\{\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]:\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},x\\in\\mathsf{NVar},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0E}=\n\\{\\forall xA\\to A[x:=t]:\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},x\\in\\mathsf{NVar},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0D}=\n\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},x\\notin\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^0D}=\n\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},x\\notin\\operatorname{FVN}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1E}=\n\\{\\forall XA\\to A[X:=Y]:\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},X,Y\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1E}=\n\\{\\forall XA\\to A[X:=Y]:\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},X,Y\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1D}=\n\\{\\forall X(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall XB):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},X\\notin\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall^1D}=\n\\{\\forall X(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall XB):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},X\\notin\\operatorname{FVS}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=R}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=R}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=Sub}=\n\\{s\\doteq t\\to(C[z:=s]\\to C[z:=t]):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},z\\in\\mathsf{NVar},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=Sub}=\n\\{s\\doteq t\\to(C[z:=s]\\to C[z:=t]):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},z\\in\\mathsf{NVar},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基本算术公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\ S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\ x+0\\doteq x,\\ x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\ S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\ x+0\\doteq x,\\ x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\times0\\doteq0,\\ x\\times S(y)\\doteq x\\times y+x,\\ \\neg x&lt;0,\\ x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\times0\\doteq0,\\ x\\times S(y)\\doteq x\\times y+x,\\ \\neg x&lt;0,\\ x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>完整二阶归纳方案为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ind}}=\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{NVar},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ind}}=\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{NVar},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-全可理解公理\">5. 全可理解公理</h1>\n<p>全可理解方案为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FullCA}}=\n\\{\\exists X\\forall n(n\\in X\\leftrightarrow A):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ n\\in\\mathsf{NVar},\\\nX\\in\\mathsf{SVar},\\ X\\notin\\operatorname{FVS}(A),\\\nn\\notin\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FullCA}}=\n\\{\\exists X\\forall n(n\\in X\\leftrightarrow A):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ n\\in\\mathsf{NVar},\\\nX\\in\\mathsf{SVar},\\ X\\notin\\operatorname{FVS}(A),\\\nn\\notin\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundN}(A)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中被数数量词绑定的变量集合；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 已被绑定，则先作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 不允许在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中自由出现，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可以含任意数参数、集合参数、数数量词和集合数量词。</p>\n<p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Z_2}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{2Logic}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ind}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FullCA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Z_2}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{2Logic}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Ind}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{FullCA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall XA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall XA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分离规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数全称推广规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^0}=\n\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^0}=\n\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>集合全称推广规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^1}=\n\\{((A),\\forall XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^1}=\n\\{((A),\\forall XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\\ X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-改名规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\n\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\n\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-有限证明对象\">7. 有限证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的证明对象是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(C_0,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(C_0,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\">\\(C_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{m-1}=C\">\\(C_{m-1}=C\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\">\\(C_i\\)</span> 满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(C_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Z_2}\">\\(C_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Z_2}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((C_j,C_k),C_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\">\\(((C_j,C_k),C_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{NVar}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i=\\forall xC_j\">\\(C_i=\\forall xC_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FVN}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FVN}(G)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{SVar}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i=\\forall XC_j\">\\(C_i=\\forall XC_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FVS}(G)\">\\(X\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FVS}(G)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((C_j),C_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\">\\(((C_j),C_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{Z_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{Z_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 满足上述六项行条件。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>可证性关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{Z_2}C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\operatorname{Proof}_{Z_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{Z_2}C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\operatorname{Proof}_{Z_2}(\\Gamma,\\pi,C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{Z_2}=\n(\\mathsf{NVar},\\mathsf{SVar},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2},\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\n\\operatorname{FV_T},\\operatorname{FVN},\\operatorname{FVS},\nSub_T^{Z_2},Sub_N^{Z_2},Sub_S^{Z_2},\n\\operatorname{BoundN},\\operatorname{BoundS},\\equiv_\\alpha,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Z_2},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^1},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{Z_2},\\vdash_{Z_2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{Z_2}=\n(\\mathsf{NVar},\\mathsf{SVar},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{Z_2},\\mathsf{Frm}_{Z_2},\n\\operatorname{FV_T},\\operatorname{FVN},\\operatorname{FVS},\nSub_T^{Z_2},Sub_N^{Z_2},Sub_S^{Z_2},\n\\operatorname{BoundN},\\operatorname{BoundS},\\equiv_\\alpha,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Z_2},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall^1},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{Z_2},\\vdash_{Z_2}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只刻画全二阶算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_2\">\\(Z_2\\)</span> 的句法、公理和有限证明关系；不包含语义载体、赋值、满足关系、有效性、语义后承，并且不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ACA_0\">\\(ACA_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\\operatorname{-AC}_0\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\operatorname{-AC}_0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-模型语义系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-逻辑与算术